TEXT OVERLAY: HIDDEN INSIDE
PROMPT: Design a cinematic archaeology-documentary thumbnail, 1280x720, 16:9. Extreme close view of a clean split animal-bone teaching replica on a dark stone surface, angled from lower-left to center-right. Its hard outer wall and neutral wax-model interior are clearly visible; a small unmodified stone flake nearby provides context. Side lighting creates tactile relief and a restrained gold highlight, rich charcoal background, shallow depth of field. One dominant bone shape, one secondary stone, large uncluttered empty area in the upper-right for the editor to add HIDDEN INSIDE. No people, no children anywhere, no flesh or blood, no human remains, no fake microscopic symbols, no fire, no glowing arrows, no logos, no watermark, no generated lettering. Scientifically modest educational reconstruction, visually compelling at mobile size.

4.
TITLE EN: The Mountain Cave That Kept a Denisovan Secret
TIẾNG VIỆT: Hang núi đã giữ kín một bí mật Denisovan
TEXT OVERLAY: WHAT WAS HIDDEN?
